          caption: "Under the drapes the anaesthetised patient cannot report loin pain and nobody can see the urticaria. What remains visible is the blood pressure, the airway pressure, the oozing wound and the colour of the urine — so the catheter bag is in the team's line of sight whenever blood is running.",
